      "summary": "\"Solana is the most used blockchain in the world. And I think that people, once they trade on Solana, they have a hard time wanting to go back to using any other traditional rail. There's over half a million users that have real world assets in their wallets around the world... The vision for Solana is this idea of Internet Capital Markets, connecting the world's internet users, of which there are 5.5, 6 billion, with the world's global productive assets. And so that's anything that can be tokenized, from commodities like gold and silver, to stocks.\" — Nick Ducoff, Head of Institutional Growth at the Solana Foundation on @FINTECHTVglobal",
